-- The Book of Artisans (trainer 200001) also teaches the recipes the realm's profession trainers
-- teach (#5818): every spell a `trainer`.`Type` 2 trainer teaches under First Aid, Blacksmithing,
-- Leatherworking, Alchemy, Cooking, Mining, Tailoring, Engineering, Enchanting, Jewelcrafting and
-- Inscription, at the lowest skill, level and cost any of those trainers asks. Weapon masters share
-- trainer type 2 but teach no trade, so their skills are not here. The book sends only the rows the
-- character can train, so a recipe shows for a trade they know once their skill reaches it.
-- mod-book-of-artisans rebuilds 200001's profession rows from its own file; this update sorts after
-- it and adds the recipes on top, touching no row of the module's.
